T1  - Effect of Costimulatory Blockade With Abatacept After Ustekinumab Withdrawal in Patients With Moderate to Severe Plaque Psoriasis: The PAUSE Randomized Clinical Trial.
T3  - Comment in: JAMA Dermatol. 2021 Nov 1;157(11):1269-1271 PMID: 34643654 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/34643654]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1001/jamadermatol.2021.3492
A1  - Harris, Kristina M
A1  - Smilek, Dawn E
A1  - Byron, Margie
A1  - Lim, Noha
A1  - Barry, William T
A1  - McNamara, James
A1  - Garcet, Sandra
A1  - Konrad, Robert J
A1  - Stengelin, Martin
A1  - Bathala, Pradeepthi
A1  - Korman, Neil J
