T1  - The Safety and Immunologic Effectiveness of the Live Varicella-Zoster Vaccine in Patients Receiving Tumor Necrosis Factor Inhibitor Therapy : A Randomized Controlled Trial.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.7326/M20-6928
A1  - Curtis, Jeffrey R
A1  - Cofield, Stacey S
A1  - Bridges, S Louis Jr
A1  - Bassler, John
A1  - Deodhar, Atul
A1  - Ford, Theresa L
