T1  - Guselkumab demonstrated an independent treatment effect in reducing fatigue after adjustment for clinical response-results from two phase 3 clinical trials of 1120 patients with active psoriatic arthritis.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s13075-021-02554-3
A1  - Rahman, Proton
A1  - Mease, Philip J
A1  - Helliwell, Philip S
A1  - Deodhar, Atul
A1  - Gossec, Laure
