T1  - Three-year efficacy and safety of certolizumab pegol for the treatment of plaque psoriasis: results from the randomized phase 3 CIMPACT trial.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/jdv.17486
A1  - Warren, R B
A1  - Lebwohl, M
A1  - Sofen, H
