T1  - Preclinical and clinical characterization of the RORgammat inhibitor JNJ-61803534.
T3  - Erratum in: Sci Rep. 2022 Apr 6;12(1):5740 PMID: 35388049 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/35388049]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/s41598-021-90497-9
A1  - Xue, Xiaohua
A1  - De Leon-Tabaldo, Aimee
A1  - Luna-Roman, Rosa
A1  - Castro, Glenda
