T1  - Comparative effectiveness of two adalimumab biosimilars in 1318 real-world patients with inflammatory rheumatic disease mandated to switch from originator adalimumab: nationwide observational study emulating a randomised clinical trial.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1136/annrheumdis-2021-219951
A1  - Nabi, Hafsah
A1  - Georgiadis, Stylianos
A1  - Loft, Anne Gitte
