ID  - 33891953
T1  - Impact of Biological Agents on Imaging and Biomarkers of Cardiovascular Disease in Patients with Psoriasis: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis of Randomized Placebo-Controlled Trials.
T3  - Comment in: J Invest Dermatol. 2021 Oct;141(10):2322-2325 PMID: 34560915 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/34560915] Comment in: J Invest Dermatol. 2021 Oct;141(10):2325-2327 PMID: 34560916 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/34560916]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jid.2021.03.024
A1  - Gonzalez-Cantero, Alvaro
A1  - Ortega-Quijano, Daniel
A1  - Alvarez-Diaz, Noelia
A1  - Ballester, Maria Asuncion
A1  - Jimenez-Gomez, Natalia
A1  - Jaen, Pedro
A1  - Gonzalez-Cantero, Jorge
A1  - Gonzalez-Calvin, Jorge Luis
