T1  - Bimekizumab versus Secukinumab in Plaque Psoriasis.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1056/NEJMoa2102383
A1  - Reich, Kristian
A1  - Warren, Richard B
A1  - Lebwohl, Mark
A1  - Gooderham, Melinda
A1  - Strober, Bruce
A1  - Langley, Richard G
A1  - Paul, Carle
A1  - De Cuyper, Dirk
A1  - Vanvoorden, Veerle
