T1  - Discontinuation of infliximab in patients with ulcerative colitis in remission (HAYABUSA): a multicentre, open-label, randomised controlled trial.
T3  - Comment in: Lancet Gastroenterol Hepatol. 2021 Jun;6(6):412-413 PMID: 33887263 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/33887263] Comment in: Lancet Gastroenterol Hepatol. 2021 Sep;6(9):687-688 PMID: 34391517 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/34391517] Comment in: Lancet Gastroenterol Hepatol. 2021 Sep;6(9):688 PMID: 34391518 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/34391518]
