T1  - The risk of malignancy in patients with secukinumab-treated psoriasis, psoriatic arthritis and ankylosing spondylitis: analysis of clinical trial and postmarketing surveillance data with up to five years of follow-up.
T3  - Comment in: Br J Dermatol. 2021 Nov;185(5):879 PMID: 34402525 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/34402525]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/bjd.20136
A1  - Lebwohl, M
A1  - Deodhar, A
A1  - Griffiths, C E M
A1  - Menter, M A
A1  - Poddubnyy, D
A1  - Bao, W
