T1  - Treatment With Tofacitinib in Refractory Psoriatic Arthritis: A National Multicenter Study of the First 87 Patients in Clinical Practice.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3899/jrheum.201204
A1  - Galindez-Agirregoikoa, Eva
A1  - Prieto-Pena, Diana
