T1  - Efficacy and safety of tildrakizumab in Japanese patients with moderate to severe plaque psoriasis: Results from a 64-week phase 3 study (reSURFACE 1).
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/1346-8138.15789
A1  - Igarashi, Atsuyuki
A1  - Nakagawa, Hidemi
A1  - Morita, Akimichi
A1  - Okubo, Yukari
