T1  - Long-term efficacy and safety of tildrakizumab in Japanese patients with moderate to severe plaque psoriasis: Results from a 5-year extension of a phase 3 study (reSURFACE 1).
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/1346-8138.15763
A1  - Imafuku, Shinichi
A1  - Nakagawa, Hidemi
A1  - Igarashi, Atsuyuki
A1  - Morita, Akimichi
