ID  - 33277982
T1  - Is Treatment in Patients With Suspected Nonradiographic Axial Spondyloarthritis Effective? Six-Month Results of a Placebo-Controlled Trial.
T3  - Comment in: Arthritis Rheumatol. 2021 Dec;73(12):2351-2352 PMID: 34180157 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/34180157] Comment in: Arthritis Rheumatol. 2021 Dec;73(12):2352-2353 PMID: 34180159 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/34180159]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/art.41607
A1  - Rusman, Tamara
A1  - van der Weijden, Mignon A C
A1  - Nurmohamed, Michael T
A1  - Landewe, Robert B M
A1  - de Winter, Janneke J H
A1  - Boden, Bouke J H
A1  - Bet, Pierre M
