T1  - Depletion of LAG-3+ T Cells Translated to Pharmacology and Improvement in Psoriasis Disease Activity: A Phase I Randomized Study of mAb GSK2831781.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/cpt.2091
A1  - Ellis, Joanne
A1  - J B Marks, Daniel
A1  - Srinivasan, Naren
