T1  - Patient-reported outcomes of adalimumab, phototherapy, and placebo in the Vascular Inflammation in Psoriasis Trial: A randomized controlled study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jaad.2019.05.080
A1  - Noe, Megan H
A1  - Wan, Marilyn T
A1  - Shin, Daniel B
