T1  - Etanercept treatment for extended oligoarticular juvenile idiopathic arthritis, enthesitis-related arthritis, or psoriatic arthritis: 6-year efficacy and safety data from an open-label trial.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s13075-019-1916-9
A1  - Foeldvari, Ivan
A1  - Constantin, Tamas
A1  - Vojinovic, Jelena
A1  - Horneff, Gerd
