T1  - Dual inhibition of tumour necrosis factor and interleukin-17A with ABT-122: open-label long-term extension studies in rheumatoid arthritis or psoriatic arthritis.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/rheumatology/key173
A1  - Genovese, Mark C
A1  - Weinblatt, Michael E
A1  - Mease, Philip J
A1  - Aelion, Jacob A
A1  - Peloso, Paul M
