ID  - 29747232
T1  - Efficacy and safety of ixekizumab in a randomized, double-blinded, placebo-controlled phase IIIb study of patients with moderate-to-severe genital psoriasis.
T3  - Comment in: Br J Dermatol. 2018 Oct;179(4):811-812 PMID: 30318814 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/30318814]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/bjd.16736
A1  - Ryan, C
A1  - Menter, A
A1  - Guenther, L
A1  - Blauvelt, A
A1  - Bissonnette, R
A1  - Meeuwis, K
