T1  - Secukinumab improves active psoriatic arthritis symptoms and inhibits radiographic progression: primary results from the randomised, double-blind, phase III FUTURE 5 study.
T3  - Comment in: Ann Rheum Dis. 2019 Sep;78(9):e97 PMID: 29853450 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/29853450]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1136/annrheumdis-2017-212687
A1  - Mease, Philip
A1  - van der Heijde, Desiree
A1  - Landewe, Robert
A1  - Mpofu, Shephard
A1  - Rahman, Proton
A1  - Tahir, Hasan
A1  - Singhal, Atul
A1  - Boettcher, Elke
A1  - Navarra, Sandra
