ID  - 29247148
T1  - Efficacy and Safety of Ixekizumab in Patients with Active Psoriatic Arthritis: 52-week Results from a Phase III Study (SPIRIT-P1).
T3  - Erratum in: J Rheumatol. 2018 Nov;45(11):1608 PMID: 30385700 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/30385700]
