556. 
TY  - JOUR
DB  - Ovid MEDLINE(R) PubMed-not-MEDLINE <2017 to 2019>
ID  - 29556416
T1  - 4-year results from the RAPID-PsA phase 3 randomised placebo-controlled trial of certolizumab pegol in psoriatic arthritis.
T3  - Erratum in: RMD Open. 2018 Mar 26;4(1): PMID: 29595841 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/29595841]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1136/rmdopen-2017-000582
A1  - van der Heijde, Desiree
A1  - Deodhar, Atul
A1  - FitzGerald, Oliver
